{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20842","headline":"河南府试十二月乐词 三月 · 李贺","name":"河南府试十二月乐词 三月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东方风来满眼春，花城柳暗愁杀人。\n复宫深殿竹风起，新翠舞衿净如水。\n光风转蕙百余里，暖雾驱云扑天地。\n军装宫妓扫蛾浅，摇摇锦旗夹城暖。\n曲水漂香去不归，梨花落尽成秋苑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}